Work Package 5 (WP5) ensures that the Digital Twin and all supporting computer models are accurate, trustworthy, and ready for long-term use during and after the project.
To guarantee scientific and clinical reliability across all partners, the team is focusing on three main actions:

• Verifying model reliability: Creating strict testing and validation plans based on international medical device and simulation standards to ensure the Digital Twin remains accurate over time.

• Measuring data precision: Training partners to carefully calculate measurement accuracy and natural variability at every step of the modeling process.

• Sharing open, reproducible data: Organizing and documenting all datasets and workflows under international FAIR principles so other researchers can easily reuse and verify the work.
